    "Register your interest": "登记您的参会意向",
    "Nine categories. Takes about two minutes.": "九个类别。大约需要两分钟。",
    "Registration is open and takes about two minutes. The Secretariat makes\ncontact as fees, categories and the full programme are confirmed. Registration\ncarries no charge.": "登记现已开放,大约需要两分钟。秘书处将在费用、类别和完整议程确认后与您联系。登记免费。",
    "Categories": "类别",
    "Select the category that describes the organisation best. Exhibiting and\npartnering are separate tick-boxes on the form, so a producer can register as a\nproducer and as an exhibitor.": "请选择最能描述您所在机构的类别。参展和合作伙伴是表格上的独立勾选项,因此生产商可以既登记为生产商,也登记为参展商。",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Government / institutional delegate</span>\n    <p>Public officials, regulators, trade agencies, diplomatic missions, industry bodies and development institutions attending in an official capacity.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">政府/机构代表</span>\n    <p>以官方身份出席的公职人员、监管机构、贸易机构、外交使团、行业组织和发展机构。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Tea producer / processor</span>\n    <p>Growers, estates, smallholder organisations and factories producing or processing tea.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">茶叶生产商/加工商</span>\n    <p>种植者、茶园、小农组织以及生产或加工茶叶的工厂。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">End-user / tea beverage brand</span>\n    <p>Consumer brands, blenders, packers, tea houses and hospitality businesses buying tea to sell on.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">终端用户/茶饮料品牌</span>\n    <p>采购茶叶进行再销售的消费品牌、拼配商、包装商、茶馆和餐饮企业。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Trader / merchant</span>\n    <p>Exporters, importers, distributors and brokers moving tea between markets.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">贸易商/经销商</span>\n    <p>在不同市场之间运输茶叶的出口商、进口商、分销商和经纪人。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Machinery and packaging equipment supplier</span>\n    <p>Manufacturers and suppliers of processing equipment, packaging lines and agricultural technology.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">机械和包装设备供应商</span>\n    <p>加工设备、包装生产线和农业技术的制造商和供应商。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Investor / financial institution</span>\n    <p>Investors, banks, insurers and development finance institutions active across the tea value chain.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">投资者/金融机构</span>\n    <p>在茶叶价值链中活跃的投资者、银行、保险公司和开发性金融机构。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Media</span>\n    <p>Journalists, editors, producers, photographers and recognised industry media.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">媒体</span>\n    <p>记者、编辑、制片人、摄影师和公认的行业媒体。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Academic / research institution</span>\n    <p>Universities, research institutes, trainers and standards specialists.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">学术/研究机构</span>\n    <p>大学、研究院所、培训机构和标准专家。</p>",
    "<span class=\"class-row__name\">Other / observer</span>\n    <p>Anyone with a professional interest in the Kenya-China tea trade who does not fit the categories above.</p>": "<span class=\"class-row__name\">其他/观察员</span>\n    <p>对Kenya-China Tea Summit茶叶贸易具有专业兴趣但不属于上述类别的任何人士。</p>",
