    "Required fields are marked. Your details are used to contact you about the summit, and are never sold. Our email and hosting providers handle them on our behalf — see the <a href=\"/privacy/\">privacy notice</a>.": "必填项已标注。您的详细信息仅用于与您联系峰会相关事宜,绝不出售给第三方。我们的电子邮件和托管服务提供商代表我们处理这些信息——请参阅<a href=\"/privacy/\">隐私声明</a>。",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-name\">Full name <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" required autocomplete=\"name\" maxlength=\"120\">": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-name\">全名 <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-name\" name=\"name\" type=\"text\" required autocomplete=\"name\" maxlength=\"120\">",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-email\">Email <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\" maxlength=\"180\">": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-email\">电子邮箱 <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required autocomplete=\"email\" maxlength=\"180\">",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-phone\">Mobile number, with country code <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-phone\" name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" required autocomplete=\"tel\" maxlength=\"32\" placeholder=\"+254 111 491 076\">": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-phone\">手机号码(含国家代码)<span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-phone\" name=\"phone\" type=\"tel\" required autocomplete=\"tel\" maxlength=\"32\" placeholder=\"+254 111 491 076\">",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-org\">Organisation <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-org\" name=\"organisation\" type=\"text\" required autocomplete=\"organization\" maxlength=\"160\">": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-org\">所属机构 <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-org\" name=\"organisation\" type=\"text\" required autocomplete=\"organization\" maxlength=\"160\">",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-title\">Job title <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-title\" name=\"jobTitle\" type=\"text\" required autocomplete=\"organization-title\" maxlength=\"120\">": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-title\">职位 <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-title\" name=\"jobTitle\" type=\"text\" required autocomplete=\"organization-title\" maxlength=\"120\">",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-country\">Country or region <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-country\" name=\"country\" type=\"text\" required autocomplete=\"country-name\" maxlength=\"80\">": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-country\">国家或地区 <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-country\" name=\"country\" type=\"text\" required autocomplete=\"country-name\" maxlength=\"80\">",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-category\">Category <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <select class=\"input\" id=\"reg-category\" name=\"category\" required>\n        <option value=\"\">Select one</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"government\">Government / institutional delegate</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"producer\">Tea producer / processor</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"brand\">End-user / tea beverage brand</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"trader\">Trader / merchant</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"machinery\">Machinery and packaging equipment supplier</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"investor\">Investor / financial institution</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"media\">Media</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"academic\">Academic / research institution</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"other\">Other / observer</option>\n        \n      </select>": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-category\">类别 <span class=\"req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <select class=\"input\" id=\"reg-category\" name=\"category\" required>\n        <option value=\"\">请选择</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"government\">政府/机构代表</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"producer\">茶叶生产商/加工商</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"brand\">终端用户/茶饮品牌</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"trader\">贸易商/经销商</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"machinery\">机械和包装设备供应商</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"investor\">投资方/金融机构</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"media\">媒体</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"academic\">学术/研究机构</option>\n        \n        <option value=\"other\">其他/观察员</option>\n        \n      </select>",
    "Optional. Leave both unticked to attend only.": "可选。两项均不勾选则仅参会。",
    "<input class=\"check\" id=\"reg-part-exhibitor\" name=\"participation\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"exhibitor\">\n      <label for=\"reg-part-exhibitor\">Exhibitor <span class=\"form__check-note\">Interested in a stand at the International Tea &amp; Technology Expo.</span></label>": "<input class=\"check\" id=\"reg-part-exhibitor\" name=\"participation\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"exhibitor\">\n      <label for=\"reg-part-exhibitor\">展商 <span class=\"form__check-note\">有意在国际茶业与技术博览会设立展位。</span></label>",
    "<input class=\"check\" id=\"reg-part-sponsor\" name=\"participation\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"sponsor\">\n      <label for=\"reg-part-sponsor\">Sponsor <span class=\"form__check-note\">Interested in a Title, Platinum, Gold, Silver or Supporting Partner package.</span></label>": "<input class=\"check\" id=\"reg-part-sponsor\" name=\"participation\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"sponsor\">\n      <label for=\"reg-part-sponsor\">赞助商 <span class=\"form__check-note\">有意成为冠名、白金、金牌、银牌或支持伙伴。</span></label>",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-website\">Website</label>\n    <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-website\" name=\"website\" type=\"url\" autocomplete=\"url\" maxlength=\"200\" placeholder=\"https://\">": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-website\">网站</label>\n    <input class=\"input\" id=\"reg-website\" name=\"website\" type=\"url\" autocomplete=\"url\" maxlength=\"200\" placeholder=\"https://\">",
    "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-message\">Brief description of interest</label>\n    <textarea class=\"input\" id=\"reg-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea>": "<label class=\"label\" for=\"reg-message\">简要说明参会意向</label>\n    <textarea class=\"input\" id=\"reg-message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" maxlength=\"2000\"></textarea>",
    "By submitting you agree the Secretariat may use your information to process your registration and contact you with updates about the Kenya-China Tea Summit 2027. Your information is shared with official event partners only as needed for registration and logistics, and is never sold. To review, correct or delete your information, email <a href=\"mailto:info@kenyachinateasummit.com\">info@kenyachinateasummit.com</a>. See our <a href=\"/privacy/\">privacy notice</a>.": "提交即表示您同意秘书处使用您的信息处理注册事宜并就Kenya-China Tea Summit 2027相关动态与您联系。您的信息仅在注册和后勤所需范围内与官方活动合作伙伴共享,绝不出售。如需查看、更正或删除您的信息,请发送邮件至<a href=\"mailto:info@kenyachinateasummit.com\">info@kenyachinateasummit.com</a>。请参阅我们的<a href=\"/privacy/\">隐私声明</a>。",
    "After registration": "注册完成后",
    "Registration confirms by email. When the delegate portal opens, delegates\nsign in with that email address to update details, book a stand, request B2B\nmeetings and download documents.": "注册确认将通过电子邮件发送。代表门户开放后,代表可使用该电子邮件地址登录,更新详细信息、预订展位、申请B2B洽谈并下载文件。",
    "Journalists apply through <a href=\"/media/\">media accreditation</a>.": "新闻记者请通过<a href=\"/media/\">媒体认证</a>申请。",
    "If you would rather exhibit or partner than attend, those go through <a href=\"/exhibition/\">Exhibition</a> and <a href=\"/sponsorship/\">Partnership</a> instead — different forms, different information needed.": "如果您更愿意参展或成为合作伙伴而非参会,请通过<a href=\"/exhibition/\">展览</a>和<a href=\"/sponsorship/\">合作</a>页面办理——不同的表格,需要不同的信息。",
